{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Late Night", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking and Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this. Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the structure:<br/>Can/Could + you + show/tell + me + Question word", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how to make lasagna?<br/>Could you show me where the washrooms are?<br/>Could you tell me what is on the dessert menu?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To give advice, you can use the structure:<br/>Let me show/tell + you + question word", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Let me show you where it is.<br/>Let me tell you what you should do.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Could you explain to me what the problem is?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Could you tell me where that club is?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. <br/><br/>The combination of the verb and preposition changes the meaning of the verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some phrasal verbs related to social activities:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "to get along -- to have a good relationship with a person<br/>to ask out -- to invite a person to an activity with a romantic intention<br/>to go out -- to leave the house, to go to a place or places in the town or city<br/>to try out -- to experiment with something new<br/>to check out -- to experience something new<br/>to come out -- to join other people at a social activity or event<br/>to cheer up -- to feel better (mood or humor)<br/>to dress up -- to put on nice clothes", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You conjugate phrasal verbs in the same way you conjugate other verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I go out on Saturdays.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you go out on Saturdays?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<Present tense class=\\\"italic\\\">Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am going out this evening.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you going out this evening?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I went out last Saturday.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you go out last Saturday?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have gone out every Saturday this month. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have you gone out every Saturday this month?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect tense\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I asked Margaret out on a date. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We went out until about 2:00 a.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you have to dress up to go there?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to ask out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to invite a person to an activity with a romantic intention (such as a date)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I asked Margaret out on a date.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social outings.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to cheer up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel better in your mood, humor", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I'm sure that would cheer you up! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be supervised", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be observed and evaluated by your boss", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't need to be supervised like that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "controlling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "wanting to control everything", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My boss is very controlling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be set in your ways", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be inflexible, not willing to compromise or listen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  She seems pretty set in her ways.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "it would be a good idea", "type": "name"}, {"content": "it is advisable, recommended", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's your boss, so it would be a good idea to listen to her.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss different things you can do in the evening where you live, such as seeing live music, going to a play, etc.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an article for a blog or a newspaper telling people what they can do in the evening. This is called a \u201cNight on the Town\u201d column.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give at least 5 suggestions of activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write details such as the location, hours and price of each activity. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what is advisable.  Use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cYou ought to ...\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIt would be a good idea to ...\u201d</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your article.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your article to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about things to do in the evening.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say what is advisable.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  Hi Frank! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:   Hi Julia!  What do you think about your new job as a server at Bistro 88? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: It's OK, I'm just not sure if I'm going to get along with the manager. It's this woman named Vanessa.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: Could you explain to me what the problem is? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: Yes, she's very controlling. She is always watching what I do and telling me how to do things differently."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: Well, she's your boss, so it would be a good idea to listen to her. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: I understand, but I don't need to be supervised like that. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: You ought to have a conversation with her. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: She seems pretty set in her ways. What did you do last night?"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "42000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: I asked Margaret out on a date.  We had a pretty late night. We went out until about 2:00 a.m. We tried out a new club called Angelo's. They had some live music playing. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  That's so cool! Could you tell me where that club is? I'd like to check it out. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: It's on the corner of Sandals and John street.  You ought to come out with us next time. I'm sure that would cheer you up!  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  I would love to!  Do you have to dress up to go there? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: No, that's not necessary. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  Perfect!  I'm in."}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write  about what is advisable.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you like to dress up? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " When do you have to dress up? What do you wear? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "We're going out on the town! We have to dress up!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Julia works as a server at Bistro 88. She has a different view of Vanessa ... ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"cont